WEBVTT

00:01:38.280 --> 00:01:42.960
- What's wrong with you? - It looks like you saw a dead person rise.

00:01:42.960 --> 00:01:45.720
That's exactly what I just saw.

00:02:32.200 --> 00:02:34.200
Choose the pen that you like the most

00:02:34.200 --> 00:02:36.120
What for? It doesn't have tunas

00:02:36.120 --> 00:02:38.120
Nobals are the ones who give tunas

00:02:38.120 --> 00:02:41.250
7 seconds

00:02:41.250 --> 00:02:43.170
And why do you have to choose a pen?

00:02:43.170 --> 00:02:45.650
To record our initials

00:02:45.650 --> 00:02:59.440
This is true

00:02:59.440 --> 00:03:00.000
Yes, nobals

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:04.350
Come on, Maclobio. You have to put a heart through an arrow.

00:03:04.350 --> 00:03:07.680
That's right. I forgot.

00:03:33.230 --> 00:03:38.430
And now, you won't be able to love anyone else but me.

00:03:38.430 --> 00:03:40.580
Neither can I love anyone else.

00:03:40.580 --> 00:03:45.340
And if we don't keep our promise, God will punish us.

00:03:45.340 --> 00:03:48.480
Are you afraid?

00:03:48.480 --> 00:03:50.960
And you aren't?

00:03:50.960 --> 00:03:53.490
I'm not, because I'll never stop loving you.

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:03.950
- Me neither. - We forgot something else.

00:04:04.870 --> 00:04:11.010
- What? - That we have to kiss.

00:04:56.330 --> 00:05:00.000
Do you know what the other landowners accuse you of?

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:03.110
Of course, Mr. Sebastian. An anarchist.

00:05:03.110 --> 00:05:06.240
And I accuse you of being hypocrites and anti-Christian.

00:05:06.240 --> 00:05:09.160
Even though every day you confess and rebuke.

00:05:09.160 --> 00:05:14.350
But how is that possible, Gabriel?

00:05:14.350 --> 00:05:17.060
Don't mess with me with your arguments.

00:05:17.060 --> 00:05:24.070
I would have done the same in your place.

00:05:31.340 --> 00:05:36.160
- What are we arguing about then? - Nothing. Nothing.

00:05:39.050 --> 00:05:50.700
You know what, Gabriel? Your renunciation of your earthly goods was a great example.

00:05:51.870 --> 00:06:00.000
Well, my motives were personal, selfish maybe, not as disinterested as yours.

00:06:00.380 --> 00:06:07.840
You lie, you lie out of modesty, out of humility.

00:06:10.600 --> 00:06:14.100
I've traveled a lot, Gabriel.

00:06:14.400 --> 00:06:17.340
I know the world, the human condition.

00:06:19.520 --> 00:06:23.220
And I've met very few people with your disinterest in material things.

00:06:23.520 --> 00:06:26.580
And with your love for others.

00:06:26.880 --> 00:06:30.000
I'm sorry.

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:32.230
I don't care about Maclobio's future.

00:06:32.330 --> 00:06:34.050
Why?

00:06:34.150 --> 00:06:36.950
With what he has left of the hacienda, his future is assured.

00:06:38.190 --> 00:06:39.090
No.

00:06:39.190 --> 00:06:41.090
I was referring to the legacy of hatred and bad intentions

00:06:41.190 --> 00:06:44.240
that you will leave him one day.

00:07:01.690 --> 00:07:03.880
He will know how to face it.

00:07:03.880 --> 00:07:07.840
Hopefully, Leonardo.

00:07:07.840 --> 00:07:13.860
I told you to leave her alone.

00:07:13.860 --> 00:07:14.980
She's my girlfriend.

00:07:14.980 --> 00:07:17.250
Liar! What do you want from me?

00:07:17.250 --> 00:07:19.040
I'm going to break your snout.

00:07:33.320 --> 00:07:38.290
Maclovio! Martín! Enough!

00:07:38.290 --> 00:07:40.690
Quiet! Enough!

00:07:40.690 --> 00:07:42.520
Enough, thugs!

00:07:42.520 --> 00:07:43.890
What the hell is that?

00:07:43.890 --> 00:07:45.680
What kind of behavior is that?

00:07:45.680 --> 00:07:47.160
Just look at that!

00:07:47.160 --> 00:07:48.660
Hold him tight!

00:07:48.660 --> 00:07:50.710
Raise your head!

00:07:50.710 --> 00:07:54.040
Now you! Now your house!

00:07:54.040 --> 00:07:55.250
Let's go!

00:07:55.250 --> 00:07:59.320
Listen to me, Maclovio.

00:08:00.600 --> 00:08:05.340
As I will surprise you again by fighting with Martin because of Soledad,

00:08:05.340 --> 00:08:08.130
I'm the one who's going to beat you up.

00:08:08.130 --> 00:08:13.270
I'm a priest, but I have a heavy hand.

00:08:13.270 --> 00:08:22.570
What do you have in your eye?

00:08:22.570 --> 00:08:25.960
Once again for Soledad?

00:08:25.960 --> 00:08:28.990
When will you teach me to shoot like your father?

00:08:30.190 --> 00:08:33.930
I want to challenge Duelo Martín Herrera.

00:08:33.930 --> 00:08:38.210
Is it bad that I want to be alone, Dad?

00:08:38.210 --> 00:08:43.420
No, son, it's not bad. It's premature.

00:08:43.420 --> 00:08:50.530
I mean, at your age, you should think and worry about other things.

00:08:50.530 --> 00:09:00.000
In studying, for example. In getting to do a career so that when you become a man, you can earn your living.

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:11.180
life honestly. But what for? If you have a lot of money. No son, you should not count on that.

00:09:11.180 --> 00:09:22.560
Why? You must achieve it for yourself. But why dad? Because a man has to fight in life

00:09:22.560 --> 00:09:30.000
to open up and get everything he needs for his own effort. Not at the expense

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:51.010
of the sweat of the others a few days ago I made a decision that worried me but

00:09:51.010 --> 00:09:59.270
now I'm sure I did well I just gave a large part of the hacienda maclovio

00:10:00.000 --> 00:10:10.690
I'm going to try to explain it to you.

00:10:10.690 --> 00:10:28.420
When your mother died, you were only two years old.

00:10:33.800 --> 00:10:39.990
Maybe you understand me if I tell you that I loved her as much as you love Soledad.

00:10:42.170 --> 00:10:47.450
I left you under the care of Father Gabriel and I went around the world trying to forget.

00:10:49.940 --> 00:10:52.820
You came back when I was four years old.

00:10:55.190 --> 00:11:00.000
I know, son. I forgot that you needed me too.

00:11:01.150 --> 00:11:03.300
But before you were too young, dad.

00:11:03.400 --> 00:11:10.450
Now you're different. I love you very much.

00:11:11.750 --> 00:11:20.380
Well, son. Traveling I learned that there's a lot of sadness.

00:11:20.400 --> 00:11:25.870
A lot of misery and a lot of injustice in the world.

00:11:25.890 --> 00:11:30.000
That while some of us have too much, others have more.

00:11:33.290 --> 00:11:44.430
- Have you seen how the peasants live? - In the jackals.

00:11:44.430 --> 00:11:50.010
- And you've seen them work so well, right? - Uh-huh.

00:11:50.010 --> 00:11:57.970
- From dawn until the sun rises. - Yes, dad.

00:11:57.970 --> 00:12:00.000
Maclovio, and your food?

00:12:01.950 --> 00:12:04.250
It's as abundant and varied as ours.

00:12:04.430 --> 00:12:04.930
No.

00:12:05.750 --> 00:12:10.020
Well, those peasants are the ones who have made us rich.

00:12:10.160 --> 00:12:12.980
And I gave them much of our land, Maclobio.

00:12:16.500 --> 00:12:17.700
Do you understand, son?

00:12:22.340 --> 00:12:24.320
You'll understand when you're older.

00:12:25.620 --> 00:12:27.840
I had a meeting with the other peasants.

00:12:28.340 --> 00:12:30.000
And we decided to unite in...

00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:31.400
against Leonardo Arrieta.

00:12:32.110 --> 00:12:34.750
Either he takes the land from his Indians...

00:12:34.990 --> 00:12:37.130
or we'll do it ourselves.

00:12:37.240 --> 00:12:40.780
On Monday, we'll arm our people.

00:12:40.990 --> 00:12:43.150
But Leonardo is your best friend.

00:12:43.280 --> 00:12:45.790
You're wrong.

00:12:45.910 --> 00:12:48.880
He was.

00:12:50.420 --> 00:12:52.720
He's a renegade of his own class.

00:12:52.820 --> 00:12:54.000
Diane...

00:12:54.620 --> 00:12:57.220
Or did you forget that he married an Indian?

00:12:57.360 --> 00:12:59.860
- With a... - With a woman who was very good.

00:13:00.570 --> 00:13:04.840
...that was worth more than many that I know.

00:13:04.840 --> 00:13:06.280
Fantasies!

00:13:06.280 --> 00:13:10.340
And you listen to me well, little girl.

00:13:10.340 --> 00:13:13.510
I don't want you to see that Indian again.

00:13:13.510 --> 00:13:14.510
What Indian, dad?

00:13:14.510 --> 00:13:17.060
The son of Leonardo Arrieta, Maclobio.

00:13:17.060 --> 00:13:21.320
That's good for being a boy in our house, not for being my daughter's friend.

00:13:21.320 --> 00:13:24.290
And if you allow it, you already know what you're up to.

00:13:24.290 --> 00:13:26.340
They are two creatures, Sebastian.

00:13:26.340 --> 00:13:28.830
What does it matter that they are friends?

00:13:28.830 --> 00:13:30.000
I have not asked for your opinion.

00:13:30.640 --> 00:13:32.880
Here in this house, you do what I command and it's over.

00:13:32.880 --> 00:13:54.230
My love, don't cry, my love.

00:13:54.230 --> 00:13:57.040
Don't cry anymore, little queen.

00:16:26.720 --> 00:16:30.000
Go with Delia to the house. I'm going to fix something.

00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:54.840
- Let's go. - Sorry to interrupt your "friends" conversation.

00:17:06.680 --> 00:17:09.930
We're waiting for you in the casino. We want to talk to you.

00:17:12.350 --> 00:17:19.030
Wait, Sebastian. I'm not used to being talked to in that tone.

00:17:20.070 --> 00:17:21.830
And that goes for you too.

00:17:23.200 --> 00:17:25.000
I talk as I please.

00:17:25.220 --> 00:17:30.000
- What's going on, gentlemen? What's going on? - Nothing, nothing, sir.

00:17:30.250 --> 00:17:32.550
...we just want to talk to Leonardo.

00:17:33.120 --> 00:17:35.810
As a suspect of what it is...

00:17:36.020 --> 00:17:38.880
...I would like to participate in the conversation.

00:17:39.060 --> 00:17:41.760
Come on, let's go to the sacristy.

00:17:41.910 --> 00:17:44.970
Please, let's go.

00:17:45.140 --> 00:17:52.470
Hey, keep it, don't leave it there.

00:17:54.110 --> 00:17:56.940
You're going to see Father Gabriel!

00:18:06.010 --> 00:18:07.910
I invite you to eat at home, Benito.

00:18:07.910 --> 00:18:14.310
Thank you, Maclovio, but I have to accompany Father Gabriel to visit the poor and the sick.

00:18:14.310 --> 00:18:16.700
The ones who sing are morons.

00:18:16.700 --> 00:18:23.590
Oh, yes. How can you be rude if you are one of the others?

00:18:23.590 --> 00:18:25.480
Don't get involved, you idiot Indian.

00:18:25.480 --> 00:18:30.000
What about me? You are the truth. And what? But I depend on you.

00:18:31.660 --> 00:18:36.430
Take it away, Maclobio!

00:18:36.430 --> 00:18:38.430
Don't die, you wretch, Catrín.

00:18:38.430 --> 00:18:50.730
Borrow it from God.

00:18:50.730 --> 00:18:52.740
Glory, fill my soul with the Lord.

00:18:52.740 --> 00:18:54.590
My spirit is filled with joy

00:18:54.590 --> 00:18:58.590
when I contemplate the goodness of God, my Savior.

00:19:15.390 --> 00:19:22.000
In terms of traitors, his class, subversive, and so many other things.

00:19:22.650 --> 00:19:27.050
Well, gentlemen, they say the same thing about Leon Tolstoy.

00:19:27.180 --> 00:19:28.770
And who is that guy?

00:19:30.320 --> 00:19:37.360
A Russian writer who, belonging to the nobility, also distributed his lands among the peasants.

00:19:37.360 --> 00:19:50.410
Because he has seen the misery in which they are debated, and how the privileged classes to which he himself belongs are exploited inhumanly under the protection of another autocrat.

00:19:50.410 --> 00:19:53.580
Are you saying that Don Porfirio is an autocrat?

00:19:53.580 --> 00:19:55.220
Exactly.

00:19:55.220 --> 00:19:59.190
That is treason! We must report it to the supreme government!

00:19:59.190 --> 00:20:00.000
That deserves it!

00:20:00.480 --> 00:20:03.510
Calm down, gentlemen. A bit of understanding.

00:20:04.450 --> 00:20:09.510
Understanding? After attacking the church and you still defend it, Father?

00:20:09.510 --> 00:20:15.280
I said that the church preaches the resignation of the exploited.

00:20:16.280 --> 00:20:23.060
Which to us, the rich, is very comfortable.

00:20:23.060 --> 00:20:30.000
Because you would prefer a thousand times to go through the eye of a camel with everything.

00:20:30.000 --> 00:20:32.000
a needle renouncing the Kingdom of Heaven

00:20:32.340 --> 00:20:36.740
rather than distribute a handful of his goods among the needy.

00:20:37.370 --> 00:20:40.330
I have always contributed with limosna for the poor.

00:20:40.330 --> 00:20:41.850
It is up to you, Father Gabriel.

00:20:42.070 --> 00:20:44.910
We have contributed for the reconstruction of the Church.

00:20:45.490 --> 00:20:47.130
Isn't that right, Father Gabriel?

00:20:47.130 --> 00:20:48.130
To you, Ramón.

00:20:48.890 --> 00:20:51.670
What you have left is money and greed.

00:20:51.950 --> 00:20:54.490
You should look for a word in the dictionary.

00:20:55.740 --> 00:20:59.700
A word that defines you all to perfection.

00:21:01.790 --> 00:21:12.630
- Vultures! - It's a pity, Sebastian. You'll pay for it with your life.

00:21:15.480 --> 00:21:17.380
I think you're really crazy.

00:21:18.530 --> 00:21:21.310
I'll wait for you at the river crossing, at dawn.

00:21:22.680 --> 00:21:25.250
Wait, Leonardo! Wait!

00:21:26.240 --> 00:21:29.970
I'm sure that Don Sebastian will forgive you.

00:21:31.180 --> 00:21:34.060
I'll never apologize to a scoundrel.

00:26:25.120 --> 00:26:26.340
Dios mío.

00:29:03.710 --> 00:29:28.290
-Take her. -My father was crazy.

00:29:30.030 --> 00:29:31.900
I can see that you're the same.

00:29:31.900 --> 00:29:35.440
Ah, Elodie, what are you waiting for?

00:29:35.440 --> 00:29:38.390
For me to kneel down and ask you to forgive my life?

00:29:38.390 --> 00:29:41.140
Ha! You're fucked!

00:30:05.050 --> 00:30:10.760
- Martyr me, bastard! - I'll do the same with you! - Bastard!

00:30:59.400 --> 00:31:00.000
What you got?

00:31:30.000 --> 00:31:30.710
me.

00:32:18.750 --> 00:32:20.820
What are we going to tell him?

00:32:20.820 --> 00:32:24.000
The truth is, Father, why do you have to go around?

00:32:24.000 --> 00:32:27.620
McClough is very angry and I think he'll take it.

00:32:27.620 --> 00:32:29.800
Do you want to kill him out of pity?

00:32:30.000 --> 00:32:32.560
- To turn him into a murderer? - And how to cure him?

00:32:33.060 --> 00:32:35.250
It's fine. It's been a misfortune.

00:32:35.550 --> 00:32:38.310
But sooner or later, he'll know.

00:32:38.390 --> 00:32:41.590
- That or what? - You were a good man, Benito.

00:32:42.350 --> 00:32:44.750
But I see that the revolution has hardened you.

00:32:46.110 --> 00:32:47.870
Everyone gets used to it, Father.

00:32:49.210 --> 00:32:50.290
Unless you don't eat.

00:32:50.590 --> 00:32:53.550
That's why when there's hunger, there's also revolutions.

00:32:53.750 --> 00:32:56.270
As soon as Maclobio arrives, I'll have to spread a lie.

00:32:56.990 --> 00:33:00.000
A lie? And you're not ashamed of it, Father?

00:33:01.280 --> 00:33:06.270
We need to save time, tell it little by little, in doses.

00:33:06.680 --> 00:33:08.740
It's better than a fuck-up!

00:33:09.090 --> 00:33:11.780
Look, get out of here and leave me alone, man.

00:33:14.140 --> 00:33:22.060
Forgive me, father. I don't do it to bother you.

00:33:22.290 --> 00:33:29.220
Rather, to worry you and because I'm very stubborn.

00:33:31.920 --> 00:33:36.760
If you're angry, so am I.

00:33:41.850 --> 00:33:47.100
More angry than that time when they killed Mr. Leonardo.

00:33:47.730 --> 00:33:48.920
Remember, Father?

00:35:14.520 --> 00:35:16.910
- Good morning, Father. - Good morning.

00:35:19.550 --> 00:35:21.510
I heard that Macrobius is very serious.

00:35:22.720 --> 00:35:26.400
My husband left town and I decided to bring him to Soledad.

00:35:48.330 --> 00:35:55.120
"Maclobio, Clobio, do you remember?"

00:36:01.630 --> 00:36:24.070
"Maclobio, it's me. Do you love me as much as I love you? Remember? I'll wait."

00:36:36.560 --> 00:36:46.360
Remember, you can love no one else but me.

00:36:46.360 --> 00:36:57.590
Clovio, Clovio, I love you, my Clovio, I love you.

00:37:30.000 --> 00:37:39.210
- Look. - Maclobio, Maclobio.

00:38:01.500 --> 00:38:03.880
Come in, Mr. Cura. Come in.

00:38:11.160 --> 00:38:13.090
Sit down. Sit down, please.

00:38:17.130 --> 00:38:20.900
Father Gabriel, I understand that Mr. Leonardo Arrieta...

00:38:21.210 --> 00:38:23.800
...heredited all his property in the name of his son, Maclobio...

00:38:24.180 --> 00:38:26.020
...including the estate of La Concepción...

00:38:26.370 --> 00:38:28.310
...and that he named it his albacea.

00:38:28.870 --> 00:38:29.760
Indeed.

00:38:30.480 --> 00:38:35.450
Well, as for the mentioned farm, I must inform you that by decree of the

00:38:35.450 --> 00:38:44.200
Mr. Governor, it has been expropriated because of public utility.

00:38:44.200 --> 00:38:49.910
Tell me one thing, Mr. Mayor, are there other farms in the same situation?

00:38:49.910 --> 00:38:55.670
No, no, no, it is the only affected land. In addition, on public auction,

00:38:55.670 --> 00:39:00.000
it has been granted to Mr. Sebastian Fernández, here present. But that's a

00:39:01.980 --> 00:39:04.960
I only carry out orders, Mr. Cura.

00:39:05.800 --> 00:39:08.740
It's a decree, as I said before, of the governor.

00:39:09.690 --> 00:39:15.850
Since the justice of the governor has been so expeditious to get rid of an orphan,

00:39:17.990 --> 00:39:20.650
what will he do to find out about Mr. Leonardo's murderers?

00:39:22.680 --> 00:39:28.120
Leonardo Arrieta challenged me to duel, and I killed him in my own defense.

00:39:30.510 --> 00:39:37.460
body and it turns out that he was shot in the back, killed in Mansalva.

00:39:37.460 --> 00:39:44.280
Mr. priest, according to the dictamen that works in my power, the dictamen of the forensic doctor,

00:39:44.280 --> 00:39:52.270
specifies that Mr. Arrieta was killed by a single bullet wound, but if you want,

00:39:52.270 --> 00:39:59.890
I will order an investigation, a process, it will be your word against that of Don Sebastián.

00:40:02.400 --> 00:40:10.880
You don't need to, Mr. Mayor, the only judge we'll ever be able to count on,

00:40:10.880 --> 00:40:18.600
at his time and at his time, will give justice.

00:40:18.600 --> 00:40:24.790
The government took your father's estate and gave it to Don Sebastián.

00:40:24.790 --> 00:40:30.000
But the house and everything in it is yours.

00:40:30.000 --> 00:40:36.180
I don't care about money. I just want to be by your side, Tata.

00:40:36.180 --> 00:40:40.160
I want to study and work like my father did.

00:40:40.200 --> 00:40:44.730
I never told you why I became a priest, right?

00:40:44.770 --> 00:40:47.700
I became an orphan, just like you.

00:40:47.700 --> 00:40:57.940
Why did you become a priest?

00:41:00.000 --> 00:41:03.860
Over time, I fell in love with her, too.

00:41:03.860 --> 00:41:08.440
Her name was Lucia.

00:41:08.440 --> 00:41:12.720
She was 15 years old and I was 20.

00:41:12.720 --> 00:41:22.830
For five years, I fought desperately to get a small estate and marry her.

00:41:22.830 --> 00:41:28.100
When I finally did, she died.

00:41:30.440 --> 00:41:32.940
We always dream of having a child.

00:41:36.750 --> 00:41:39.910
You can be that child for me.

00:41:40.020 --> 00:41:55.960
Out of innocence, two men attacked me in the outskirts of the town.

00:41:56.100 --> 00:41:58.800
They pick him up and bury him.

00:42:00.000 --> 00:42:01.280
Right away, my colonel.

00:42:01.280 --> 00:42:16.680
He's the son of Dicunto Arrieta.

00:42:51.920 --> 00:42:56.280
Although many years have passed, I have been waiting for you in the maquillage.

00:42:56.280 --> 00:43:00.000
Soon we will be great, Maclobio.

00:43:00.800 --> 00:43:02.660
You'll wait for me to get married, right?

00:43:02.660 --> 00:43:05.980
I swear to you.

00:43:05.980 --> 00:43:12.030
I'll work very hard to be rich.

00:43:12.030 --> 00:43:16.240
You'll never forget me?

00:43:16.240 --> 00:43:17.030
Never.

00:43:32.750 --> 00:43:38.860
I warned you that if you saw this Indian again, you would be far away from here forever.

00:43:38.860 --> 00:43:48.720
And when I give an order, it is to be respected.

00:43:48.720 --> 00:43:52.930
And if you do the opposite, you deserve a punishment. So you've been looking for it.

00:43:52.930 --> 00:43:59.730
Sebastian! How dare you? My daughter?

00:44:00.570 --> 00:44:05.890
It's not even your turn!

00:44:05.890 --> 00:44:11.410
Go away, Maclobio, go away, please.

00:44:54.120 --> 00:45:00.000
"Globio, my son! I haven't seen you in a long time!"

00:45:02.080 --> 00:45:07.250
- How have you been? - Good, Tata. How about you?

00:45:07.820 --> 00:45:12.170
- I'm good too. - And you, Benito?

00:45:16.410 --> 00:45:18.320
What happened to you?

00:45:19.660 --> 00:45:23.060
I sent you ahead so you could tell me how Tata Gabriela and Soledad were doing.

00:45:23.760 --> 00:45:24.860
And I stayed waiting for you.

00:45:25.530 --> 00:45:29.510
He didn't leave me. He just told me to tell you to come back.

00:45:30.090 --> 00:45:32.090
Oh, let him explain it to you in person, go on.

00:45:37.650 --> 00:45:40.240
I've just been at Don Sebastián's house.

00:45:40.240 --> 00:45:42.760
What happened, Tata?

00:45:42.760 --> 00:45:44.910
I don't know how to begin.

00:45:44.910 --> 00:45:54.210
The truth, Tata, without further ado.

00:45:54.210 --> 00:46:00.000
You know the hatred and resentment that Don Sebastián has for me.

00:46:00.030 --> 00:46:05.450
the peasants for looting the land and especially for the death of your father.

00:46:05.450 --> 00:46:14.480
Shortly after you and Benito joined the revolution, the peasants

00:46:14.480 --> 00:46:18.020
wanted to kill him and they already raided the residence.

00:46:18.020 --> 00:46:24.910
But, what about Soledad? What happened to Soledad, Tata?

00:46:24.910 --> 00:46:26.980
Well...

00:46:26.980 --> 00:46:29.920
Well, that day...

00:46:30.000 --> 00:46:38.630
According to Father Gabriel, the old man was in the farm with Soledad and Doña Rosario saving Ancina by a hair.

00:46:38.630 --> 00:46:49.840
That's right. Don Sebastian disappeared from the town. He should have returned with Soledad and Doña Rosario to the same place where he stayed for so many years.

00:46:49.840 --> 00:47:00.000
Do you remember? But what are you up to? Go and shave your beard.

00:47:00.000 --> 00:47:13.870
and take a shower, you're dirty, come on son, come on, may God forgive me, but to tell him

00:47:13.870 --> 00:47:30.000
the whole truth, I would have been more ruthless.

00:47:30.000 --> 00:47:32.000
I don't know where I could have missed you.

00:47:32.000 --> 00:47:37.420
We don't have to do anything in this town anymore, Macloy.

00:47:37.420 --> 00:47:39.300
Purely bad memories.

00:47:39.300 --> 00:47:42.540
It's better to stay in the ball. I know what I'm saying.

00:47:42.540 --> 00:47:49.900
She'll come back here one day, and I'll be waiting for her.

00:47:51.910 --> 00:47:53.980
It's green.

00:47:53.980 --> 00:47:57.220
It's better to have your will that they bury you here.

00:48:00.410 --> 00:48:05.490
-What do you mean? -From what you see, Soledad will never come back.

00:48:05.490 --> 00:48:09.940
-Convince yourself. -I don't understand.

00:48:09.940 --> 00:48:17.070
-At least, she could have left me a letter. -Well, that's what I'm saying.

00:48:17.070 --> 00:48:21.610
-You forgot already, Maclovio. Convince yourself. -Let's get back to the ball.

00:48:21.610 --> 00:48:26.690
Just remember everything that happened three years ago, when we came to town.

00:48:39.150 --> 00:48:42.030
You're wasting your time, Rosenda.

00:48:42.030 --> 00:48:43.180
Maclovio?

00:48:43.180 --> 00:48:46.540
Not with you, not with anyone.

00:48:46.540 --> 00:48:49.140
He's a dead man alive.

00:48:49.140 --> 00:48:50.550
He only lives with a memory.

00:49:01.020 --> 00:49:03.020
-Hi, Maclovio. -Hi, Rosenda.

00:49:03.020 --> 00:49:14.310
-Do you want a drink? -I want you.

00:49:14.310 --> 00:49:18.060
Are you blind? Don't you have eyes for another woman?

00:49:18.060 --> 00:49:26.940
No. A creature has stolen it from me for a long time.

00:49:26.940 --> 00:49:29.760
And I don't know when I'll get it back.

00:49:34.410 --> 00:49:37.340
I hope one day I find a man like you.

00:49:37.340 --> 00:49:40.290
That's easy, Rosenda.

00:49:40.290 --> 00:49:43.810
I'm a man like everyone else.

00:49:43.810 --> 00:49:47.490
That's what you say.

00:49:47.490 --> 00:49:55.510
I will be the same as you.

00:49:55.510 --> 00:49:57.910
Forget it, Maclovio.

00:49:57.910 --> 00:49:59.600
Forget it!

00:50:00.540 --> 00:50:05.600
Soledad doesn't come back, it's been more than 15 years.

00:50:05.600 --> 00:50:08.200
Where do you get that she's still waiting for you?

00:50:08.200 --> 00:50:11.540
Because you don't know the women.

00:50:11.540 --> 00:50:18.950
There's no rumor that Don Sebastián, just like Porfirio Díaz and many other rich people, also left for Paris.

00:50:18.950 --> 00:50:25.160
I bet she married a Frenchman and even forgot to speak Mexican.

00:50:30.700 --> 00:50:32.860
You're crazy for yourself.

00:50:32.860 --> 00:50:37.370
You're like Rosenda, and you don't listen to them.

00:50:37.370 --> 00:50:40.820
Why don't you join the priesthood too?

00:50:40.820 --> 00:50:44.380
Shut up, asshole!

00:50:44.380 --> 00:50:47.270
Hey, hey, hey, I'm not your dude.

00:50:47.270 --> 00:50:50.390
That's why I went to the revolution, to stop having masters.

00:50:50.390 --> 00:50:54.230
Now we're equals, and fuck them if you want!

00:51:19.040 --> 00:51:24.550
You don't even consider me a little thing, and you don't even listen to me, right, Maclovio?

00:51:30.890 --> 00:51:34.930
I'd like you to know what it's like to love, but to love for real.

00:51:38.060 --> 00:51:39.480
You don't know what I'm carrying inside.

00:51:42.460 --> 00:51:44.560
You've never shed tears for a woman.

00:51:46.350 --> 00:51:51.860
I have. I've cried for two women I lost.

00:51:54.890 --> 00:51:56.630
My mother, when she died.

00:52:00.860 --> 00:52:25.000
I have to go now.

00:53:30.960 --> 00:53:35.480
Oh, oh.

00:55:00.510 --> 00:55:22.920
Can I talk to you?

00:55:35.880 --> 00:55:37.780
There's a limit in everything, Maclobio.

00:55:39.730 --> 00:55:42.130
Not even the pain in the man is permanent.

00:55:43.050 --> 00:55:44.560
Neither is happiness.

00:55:45.980 --> 00:55:47.000
If that were the case,

00:55:48.100 --> 00:55:50.940
boredom would end up making our lives unbearable.

00:55:53.090 --> 00:56:00.000
When... when we cling to the impossible.

00:56:01.310 --> 00:56:03.680
We became slaves to an obsession.

00:56:06.710 --> 00:56:08.510
And that's what's happening to you.

00:56:08.980 --> 00:56:13.640
Your love for Soledad is no longer love.

00:56:14.260 --> 00:56:17.040
It's a unhealthy obsession.

00:56:21.120 --> 00:56:23.080
Yes, Grandpa.

00:56:25.280 --> 00:56:28.640
My love for Soledad has become a unhealthy obsession.

00:56:32.430 --> 00:56:43.250
But you know why? Because I never knew about the tenderness of a mother.

00:56:43.250 --> 00:56:47.830
And because I had to divide my love of a child between two parents.

00:56:47.830 --> 00:56:54.960
And because when I became an orphan, fighting between life and death,

00:56:54.960 --> 00:57:00.000
it was thanks to the love of a girl that I had faith to follow.

00:57:01.660 --> 00:57:05.160
I understand, but only as far as you're concerned.

00:57:06.260 --> 00:57:11.080
Fifteen years is a lifetime.

00:57:11.640 --> 00:57:16.300
It's not possible that in so many years, Soledad has forgotten you.

00:57:18.490 --> 00:57:21.820
Haven't you started to think that during this long absence...

00:57:21.920 --> 00:57:24.140
...so many things could have happened...

00:57:24.290 --> 00:57:27.210
...that even without wanting or desiring it...

00:57:27.400 --> 00:57:30.000
...they ended up moving you away...

00:57:30.000 --> 00:57:31.000
...of her life?

00:57:31.400 --> 00:57:37.460
I can't know that until I see her again.

00:57:37.560 --> 00:57:41.200
Where? Where are you going to see her if you don't know?

00:57:41.400 --> 00:57:49.040
- I'll find her. - Listen to me, Maclobio.

00:57:49.140 --> 00:57:50.840
And if I ever find her again...

00:57:50.960 --> 00:57:54.440
...you, Tata, better than anyone else, should know that there are men...

00:57:54.580 --> 00:57:59.480
...who, no matter how men they may be, were born for a single woman.

00:58:01.720 --> 00:58:05.720
Lieutenant Colonel, last night Mr. Madero was murdered.

00:58:05.830 --> 00:58:26.040
- What happened, Tata? - As you've been, you know, Maclovio,

00:58:26.180 --> 00:58:30.000
I don't think you're going back to the Revolution.

00:58:31.660 --> 00:58:35.510
- Who's going to ask me for it? - Soledad.

00:58:38.940 --> 00:58:40.820
He returned to town last night.

00:58:44.690 --> 00:58:54.960
If you're going to fight, you'll have to fight with Don Sebastian.

00:58:56.440 --> 00:59:00.000
That's what I've been hoping for.

00:59:00.190 --> 00:59:01.730
...for many years, Tata.

00:59:01.730 --> 00:59:04.640
Tell me something, son.

00:59:04.640 --> 00:59:07.490
No matter how much a woman loves a man...

00:59:07.490 --> 00:59:11.140
...is it conceivable that she will marry...

00:59:11.140 --> 00:59:13.600
...the murderer of her father?

00:59:13.600 --> 00:59:17.760
I will not kill him, I will force him to defend himself.

00:59:17.760 --> 00:59:20.200
Well, she's the same cat, but wrapped up.

00:59:20.200 --> 00:59:22.550
Anyway, you will leave him dead.

00:59:22.550 --> 00:59:25.150
Decide it at once, Maclovio.

00:59:25.150 --> 00:59:29.560
You will have to choose between the life of Don Sebastian...

00:59:30.730 --> 00:59:32.230
And the love of Soledad.

00:59:32.230 --> 00:59:34.520
Don't be fooled.

00:59:34.520 --> 00:59:57.900
Just like my aunt Chepa, may she rest in peace.

00:59:57.900 --> 01:00:00.000
I wanted to eat chicharrones, but...

01:00:00.000 --> 01:00:01.990
I want to keep Marrano alive.

01:03:23.260 --> 01:03:23.780
Soledad.

01:03:30.220 --> 01:03:31.120
It's our fault.

01:03:31.120 --> 01:03:36.660
Time has erased everything.

01:03:36.660 --> 01:03:40.720
But not inside of us.

01:04:19.450 --> 01:04:22.260
I thought you had forgotten what I told you.

01:04:22.260 --> 01:04:29.640
Yesterday I waited for you all day and today I thought you wouldn't come either.

01:04:31.600 --> 01:04:33.940
But my father was at home, and he couldn't escape me.

01:04:33.940 --> 01:04:44.340
Did you ever think of loving yourself?

01:04:44.340 --> 01:04:49.460
Yes, I suffered a lot.

01:04:49.460 --> 01:04:57.430
I was a little girl when I told you that I would never stop loving you.

01:05:00.320 --> 01:05:13.890
Now that I'm a woman, I repeat, I'll never, never leave you.

01:05:13.890 --> 01:05:20.010
Many have told me that I'm crazy.

01:05:20.010 --> 01:05:24.840
And what do you imagine they've said about me?

01:05:24.840 --> 01:05:27.550
Where have you been all this time?

01:05:27.550 --> 01:05:29.760
What was your life? What did you do?

01:05:31.530 --> 01:05:48.340
The only thing that matters is that we are together and that we care about the past.

01:07:30.960 --> 01:07:31.440
We'll be right back.

01:08:11.160 --> 01:08:17.670
- When are you going to send me to Clovio? - As soon as the San Isidro parties are over.

01:08:26.320 --> 01:08:30.000
- My father will try to stop you. - I can't.

01:08:36.910 --> 01:08:38.910
Are you going to take revenge for what you did to your father?

01:08:38.910 --> 01:08:47.800
I truly love him.

01:08:47.800 --> 01:08:50.800
And that has erased the hatred that has been feeding me for so many years.

01:08:50.800 --> 01:08:57.970
May God bless you, Maclobio.

01:09:07.070 --> 01:09:19.340
- Run away with me. - Do you want to make me your soldier?

01:09:19.340 --> 01:09:30.000
- Against God or against men. - For me, we're done.

01:09:33.770 --> 01:09:35.270
Then we'll leave together.

01:09:35.270 --> 01:09:47.280
My mother is very sick.

01:09:47.280 --> 01:09:55.040
She is the one who has suffered the most.

01:09:55.040 --> 01:09:59.280
Not only my agony, but also the mistreatment of my father.

01:10:03.320 --> 01:10:08.830
- Now that you need me the most... - Don't follow me.

01:10:08.830 --> 01:10:16.340
Your duty is to stay by his side.

01:10:16.340 --> 01:10:20.310
Don't go to the revolution, Maclovio.

01:10:20.310 --> 01:10:27.060
That is also my duty.

01:10:27.060 --> 01:10:30.000
I'm still at risk of losing myself.

01:10:30.000 --> 01:10:39.030
Is there another way?

01:11:01.880 --> 01:11:10.760
If I die, I'll take him with me to our destiny.

01:11:10.760 --> 01:11:16.170
No, Maclobio, no.

01:11:16.170 --> 01:11:22.230
How many have had the joy of loving each other like us?

01:13:27.100 --> 01:13:30.000
Do you realize, Don Sebastian,

01:13:30.000 --> 01:13:35.380
The rebelliousness of these people is noticeable, this Adelita thing shocks me.

01:14:55.210 --> 01:14:56.080
To you, Soledad.

01:15:03.840 --> 01:15:06.340
I'm going away from here

01:15:06.340 --> 01:15:09.620
I'm going with my soul

01:15:09.620 --> 01:15:12.450
made into pieces

01:15:12.450 --> 01:15:16.610
You will not forget me

01:15:16.610 --> 01:15:19.970
I will forget you

01:15:19.970 --> 01:15:22.920
I'm going to fight

01:15:22.920 --> 01:15:26.480
until I have you

01:15:26.480 --> 01:15:29.480
in my arms

01:15:32.840 --> 01:15:40.630
I will suffer, maybe I will die, fighting for my people

01:15:40.630 --> 01:15:51.830
But I ask God that I can return to see you again

01:15:51.830 --> 01:16:00.000
That I am not of you, nor you are, he says

01:16:00.600 --> 01:16:30.000
and they will not be able to separate the paths that God has not pointed out and a great love

01:16:30.280 --> 01:16:52.600
What am I going to tell you? Shut up!

01:17:01.400 --> 01:17:04.680
That I am not yours

01:17:04.680 --> 01:17:11.240
A lot of people

01:17:11.240 --> 01:17:23.660
Lovers

01:17:23.660 --> 01:17:26.000
I'm going back

01:17:26.000 --> 01:17:28.070
And they won't be able to

01:17:28.070 --> 01:17:30.000
Separate them

01:18:16.670 --> 01:18:24.570
It has been tradition that the parish of the town directs the word on such a solemn occasion for all of us.

01:18:24.570 --> 01:18:29.670
But today I have decided to do it in my place, a speaker.

01:18:30.190 --> 01:18:35.280
...more eloquent, more original than me, Benito Pérez.

01:18:35.280 --> 01:18:38.390
But, how?

01:18:38.390 --> 01:18:46.460
What?

01:18:46.460 --> 01:18:49.040
I?

01:18:49.040 --> 01:18:54.580
Yes, sir, how can I say that?

01:18:54.580 --> 01:18:57.080
I don't know.

01:19:04.350 --> 01:19:10.280
Well, there we have in the parish of San Isidro Labrador,

01:19:10.280 --> 01:19:21.210
the boss of our town, the one who takes off and puts out the sun.

01:19:21.210 --> 01:19:25.350
And if we want good harvest, well, you know the custom, huh?

01:19:25.350 --> 01:19:30.000
We have to help our saint so that in turn he also helps the poor and the

01:19:30.000 --> 01:19:37.650
sick but we don't have to leave all the work to the saints

01:19:37.650 --> 01:19:47.220
we also have to put something on our part to work macizo and as

01:19:47.220 --> 01:19:53.230
Maclovio says learn to respect us and that they do not respect us but as today we are

01:19:53.230 --> 01:20:00.000
having fun that each man chooses his partner but that he pulls with strong money to another

01:20:00.380 --> 01:20:02.770
Paquita!

01:20:06.890 --> 01:20:08.390
Dance with Soledad Fernandez.

01:20:08.390 --> 01:20:13.540
Two thousand.

01:20:13.540 --> 01:20:17.980
Three thousand.

01:20:17.980 --> 01:20:27.250
One moment.

01:20:27.250 --> 01:20:30.000
I have a debt with Marcos.

01:20:30.000 --> 01:20:34.650
I'll support you with $5,000 so you can dance with Soledad.

01:20:34.650 --> 01:20:54.440
Now that you're taking into account, Mr. Sebastian,

01:20:54.440 --> 01:20:57.350
you and I have something to discuss.

01:20:57.350 --> 01:21:00.000
What do you think?

01:21:00.000 --> 01:21:13.350
if we talk about it all at once, all quiet gentlemen, no one intervenes, what happens to don sebastián, he lacks

01:21:13.350 --> 01:21:30.000
pants, he didn't have them either when he faced my father, that's why he killed him, you are a coward,

01:21:36.240 --> 01:21:40.660
Don Sebastián is not alone, now I am the one who supports him.

01:21:40.660 --> 01:21:47.220
I ordered them not to intervene, this is my business.

01:21:47.220 --> 01:21:53.970
Forgive me, Don Macrobio, but here we all die together by his side, whether he wants it or not.

01:21:53.970 --> 01:21:57.970
We also have some accounts pending with those bastards.

01:22:07.450 --> 01:22:27.330
You made me a promise, you were going to kill my father, all these people are going to die because of us, kill me too.

01:22:30.990 --> 01:22:42.710
- You send me, Soledad. - I don't send you, I beg you, your promise.

01:22:42.710 --> 01:23:00.000
Soledad is mine, she belongs to me.

01:23:01.950 --> 01:23:06.880
If something happens to him during my absence, they'll pay for it with their lives.

01:23:06.880 --> 01:23:09.840
Let's go, guys.

01:23:09.840 --> 01:23:11.780
Let's continue for the cause.

01:23:51.980 --> 01:23:55.800
Tell him that it won't be any help, and that we'll be there in three days.

01:23:55.800 --> 01:23:59.240
Listen, you stay and have lunch.

01:23:59.240 --> 01:24:00.000
Thank you, jefe.

01:24:00.700 --> 01:24:03.840
What are you talking about?

01:24:03.840 --> 01:24:06.920
What if I don't know how to read?

01:24:06.920 --> 01:24:11.460
Now you, go ahead.

01:24:34.920 --> 01:25:00.000
The people of the city of Tenochtitlan are the people of the city of Tenochtitlan.

01:26:09.340 --> 01:26:24.520
♪ Do you remember Falié, your mother? ♪

01:27:01.530 --> 01:27:07.110
Adios Torre de Chihuahua

01:27:07.110 --> 01:27:13.910
Adios Torre de Cantera

01:27:13.910 --> 01:27:21.540
Ya llego Francisco V

01:32:37.260 --> 01:32:51.720
and what happened to the Mountain Law.

01:32:51.760 --> 01:32:58.500
----! ----!

01:32:58.540 --> 01:33:00.000
...good songs...

01:33:02.750 --> 01:33:11.910
The ones that come out of the soul are just the daughters of deception.

01:33:11.910 --> 01:33:15.500
I hope it never comes out of you.

01:33:15.500 --> 01:33:21.030
What's wrong, Benito?

01:33:21.030 --> 01:33:26.150
I've never seen you so sad.

01:33:26.150 --> 01:33:30.000
This canija revolution, I don't understand it anymore.

01:33:33.070 --> 01:33:39.430
It's been three years and I don't know why or who we're fighting for.

01:33:39.430 --> 01:33:47.750
Zapata, the man is all alone and he's trying to get his Indians to give him the land.

01:33:47.750 --> 01:33:54.910
Puritita Madre, Maclovio. Puritita Madre.

01:33:54.910 --> 01:33:58.800
The ideals of the revolution are one thing, Benito.

01:34:00.030 --> 01:34:30.000
And the men destined to fulfill it, or they are another, the ambition of power, sometimes deviate them, sometimes, forever, since I have in my memory, pure promises, pure tales, that's right, drops of blood, but the devil,

01:34:30.030 --> 01:34:34.930
and if he hits the ground, then he forgets he was down there.

01:34:34.930 --> 01:34:38.810
- Just a mess, Maclovio. - Just a mess.

01:34:38.810 --> 01:34:39.810
Boss! Boss!

01:34:39.810 --> 01:34:44.510
The enemy is coming down the Santa Rosa hill.

01:34:44.510 --> 01:34:45.510
Get ready to fight!

01:34:45.510 --> 01:34:49.620
I don't give a shit if I have to fight ten times.

01:34:49.620 --> 01:34:51.670
It's worse if I have to fight all night.

01:34:51.670 --> 01:34:54.670
I don't know who I'm fighting with or who I'm fighting with.

01:34:54.670 --> 01:34:55.670
Venito!

01:34:55.670 --> 01:34:58.490
Make the people happy, we have to bring them to the hospital.

01:34:58.490 --> 01:35:00.000
We have to get them to the hospital.

01:35:00.000 --> 01:35:27.620
Madrazos, of course, Maclovio, Maclovio, I mean, my lieutenant colonel, how about my colonel, lieutenant colonel, doctorcito, lieutenant colonel, you were promoted, Maclovio, for merits in the campaign, live miraculously, I'm going to show you something that saved your life,

01:35:34.990 --> 01:35:37.240
He broke the bullet that was going straight to his heart.

01:35:37.240 --> 01:35:49.040
Yes, sir.

01:35:49.040 --> 01:35:52.500
It can be said that Soledad saved your life twice.

01:35:52.500 --> 01:35:55.890
No, no, that he loves you, he loves you.

01:35:55.890 --> 01:35:57.810
It's a pity that he got married.

01:35:57.810 --> 01:35:59.220
Yes.

01:36:00.570 --> 01:36:02.570
What did you say, bastard?

01:36:02.570 --> 01:36:14.440
That's right. He married Martín Herrera.

01:36:14.440 --> 01:36:22.860
But before you leave this house, remember that no matter how manly you are, you owe me some respect.

01:36:32.010 --> 01:36:34.070
All I ask of you is for you to listen to me.

01:36:34.070 --> 01:36:38.870
I'll listen to you, Tata.

01:36:38.870 --> 01:36:43.640
When you asked me about the Paradise of Soledad,

01:36:43.640 --> 01:36:47.060
fearing that you were going to commit a madness,

01:36:47.060 --> 01:36:49.520
I lied to you.

01:37:04.510 --> 01:37:20.130
The truth is that when you and Benito joined the revolution this people fell into chaos, the peasants thirsty for revenge.

01:37:48.810 --> 01:37:50.910
I told you not to mess with my things.

01:37:51.940 --> 01:37:56.600
I won't rest until I finish each one of these felins.

01:38:07.960 --> 01:38:08.900
No.

01:39:32.560 --> 01:39:39.820
A little later, poor Rosario became seriously ill due to the terrible impression.

01:39:44.640 --> 01:39:55.800
Fearing to leave her alone, she swore, being in a death sentence and in my presence, that she would marry Martín Herrera.

01:40:01.210 --> 01:40:03.200
even for the one who is not a believer.

01:40:04.330 --> 01:40:06.790
Violating the oath made to a dying man

01:40:07.320 --> 01:40:09.280
is a problem of conscience that...

01:40:13.140 --> 01:40:16.130
is a problem of conscience that you would never understand.

01:40:21.830 --> 01:40:26.080
Listen to me, son.

01:40:26.080 --> 01:40:29.000
Soledad, for love to you,

01:40:30.000 --> 01:40:32.000
Despite the remorse that tortured her.

01:40:32.000 --> 01:40:33.890
Because her mother was a saint.

01:40:33.890 --> 01:40:34.890
And you know it well.

01:40:34.890 --> 01:40:40.230
She violated her oath for almost three years.

01:40:40.230 --> 01:40:43.020
Three years.

01:40:43.020 --> 01:40:47.380
Do you realize?

01:40:47.380 --> 01:40:49.380
Three years without knowing anything about you.

01:40:49.380 --> 01:40:51.940
Always waiting for your return.

01:40:51.940 --> 01:40:56.940
But why, son?

01:40:56.940 --> 01:40:57.940
Why not a letter?

01:40:57.940 --> 01:40:59.510
Not a news?

01:41:02.940 --> 01:41:05.240
I was caught up in the revolution, Tata.

01:41:05.690 --> 01:41:12.220
There will always be a justification for any loneliness.

01:41:15.210 --> 01:41:19.160
When, finally, two months ago,

01:41:19.670 --> 01:41:21.370
we heard the news of your death,

01:41:23.950 --> 01:41:26.610
you finally decided to fulfill a sacred debt.

01:41:28.500 --> 01:41:30.000
But for you, it will always be...

01:41:31.280 --> 01:41:34.200
An unfaithful woman, any woman.

01:41:37.750 --> 01:41:39.830
But why with Martín Herrera, Tata?

01:41:40.080 --> 01:41:42.870
Because the same as you and with the same right,

01:41:43.190 --> 01:41:44.760
he also loved her from a child.

01:41:45.100 --> 01:41:48.080
Because even knowing that Soledad doesn't love him,

01:41:48.670 --> 01:41:50.470
Martín promised to respect her,

01:41:51.050 --> 01:41:52.370
to have patience,

01:41:52.860 --> 01:41:54.360
to deserve her affection.

01:41:55.810 --> 01:41:58.800
Which shows the nobility of her feelings.

01:42:01.760 --> 01:42:02.720
Soledad doesn't love him.

01:42:02.720 --> 01:42:08.380
Soledad belongs to me.

01:42:08.380 --> 01:42:11.420
I have the right to get her back.

01:42:11.420 --> 01:42:13.650
It's mine.

01:42:13.650 --> 01:42:14.560
Take it, Tata.

01:42:14.560 --> 01:42:18.030
Soledad is my wife.

01:42:18.030 --> 01:42:19.030
You don't understand.

01:42:19.030 --> 01:42:21.140
I understand perfectly.

01:42:21.140 --> 01:42:26.140
But a wife is only through the sacrament of marriage.

01:42:26.140 --> 01:42:29.270
If she came back to your side.

01:42:30.220 --> 01:42:34.560
I would commit adultery, I would seriously sin.

01:42:34.560 --> 01:42:44.840
Don't talk to me about religion, Tatra, nor about dogmas, nor about fanaticism.

01:42:44.840 --> 01:42:53.570
The one who would seriously sin would be me if I allowed Soledad to spend the rest of her days

01:42:53.570 --> 01:43:00.000
tied to the arms of a man that you and I know perfectly well that he doesn't want

01:43:00.000 --> 01:43:07.970
will ever want. If you have already forgotten my teachings and deny the

01:43:07.970 --> 01:43:14.870
religion in which you were born, do you think that Soledad, for the fact of loving you, is also

01:43:14.870 --> 01:43:24.780
capable of denying the Christian faith and rebelling against the designs of God?

01:43:24.780 --> 01:43:30.000
I married Martín Herrera and it costs me that Soledad considers him her legitimate husband.

01:43:31.530 --> 01:43:35.920
And so it will be for her, until death separates them.

01:43:35.920 --> 01:44:00.000
I know what you're thinking, come on, go provoke Martin Herrera, kill him, it will be easy for you.

01:44:01.340 --> 01:44:07.840
You are already an expert in it, at this time he and Soledad will be waiting for your return.

01:44:07.840 --> 01:44:20.840
Like the whole town, everyone will enjoy the show, but you will only be a cowardly murderer disguised as Valenton.

01:45:30.730 --> 01:45:39.320
But Clovius, but Clovius, Clovius.

01:46:13.500 --> 01:46:19.530
Goodbye, Maclobio.

01:46:19.530 --> 01:46:30.000
Don't say anything. You won't find any words or reasons for me.

01:46:30.540 --> 01:46:56.950
You want to kill Martin, you want to kill me, I will kill you, I will cry for you.

01:47:05.690 --> 01:47:09.030
But this is a farewell, and forever.

01:48:55.120 --> 01:48:57.840
Mother, she finished it.

01:49:00.090 --> 01:49:01.960
The song...

01:49:31.950 --> 01:49:39.160
If you move, Martin, you'll lose me forever.

01:50:00.830 --> 01:50:08.740
You never expected that I also wanted to record

01:50:30.090 --> 01:50:35.220
I am calm because at the end of the day

01:51:53.100 --> 01:51:55.280
New farms and Almaguer.

01:52:14.840 --> 01:52:16.840
I want to dance with Soledad Herrera.

01:52:16.840 --> 01:52:29.570
It's obvious that he doesn't dance with my wife.

01:52:34.920 --> 01:52:46.960
One moment. I will dance with Maclovia Rieta, in exchange for her to leave town and never come back.

01:52:46.960 --> 01:52:57.930
We are at your service, my colonel. But with all due respect, the lady has made you a proposal.

01:54:47.920 --> 01:54:48.820
Play the music!

01:55:13.020 --> 01:55:28.900
Thank you, Mrs. Ametata.

01:55:30.640 --> 01:55:38.390
I'm going to be shot, thank you.

01:56:04.060 --> 01:56:05.030
I'm going to get him!
